      <pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 09:30:52 +0000</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[Safe hardware validation onboarding for pending Mac models, including the 2026 Mac mini. The LED fade test restores full brightness, enables a confirmed profile only on that Mac, and submits an anonymous Yes/No result for owner review.]]></description>
